      "en": "“And you, son of man, this is what will happen on the day I take[NOTE:1] from them their stronghold—their beautiful source of joy, the object in which their eyes delight, and the main concern of their lives,[NOTE:2] as well as their sons and daughters:[NOTE:3]",
